s=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve guests with diverse tastes and meet more adorable animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friendships through food \u2014 welcome to Animal Cafe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.poster.avif?t=1749628750\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.webm?t=1749628750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/e35bbb792219796559d93dafc30021ff.mp4?t=1749628750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
